## Execution Order
1. Task 1: Bổ sung constants detail.
2. Task 2: Đồng bộ fields config.
3. Task 3: Cập nhật `Import::setting_fields()` helper.
4. Task 4: Chuẩn bị middle select trong view.
5. Task 5: Implement grouped UI active `import_index.js`.
6. Task 6: Đồng bộ active `custom.js`.
7. Task 7: Mirror sang `assets/templates`.
8. Task 8: Static consistency checks.
9. Task 9: Lint/test validation.

## Testing Checklist
- [ ] Unit/static: `php -l` cho `constants.php`, hai `fields.php`, `Import.php`.
- [ ] Unit/static: `node --check` cho 4 JS files changed nếu Node available.
- [ ] Static consistency: group map leaf ⊆ `MENU_DETAIL_SETTING_HR_IMPORT`.
- [ ] Static consistency: group map leaf ⊆ `MasterSettingImportRegistry::SCHEMAS`.
- [ ] Static consistency: Payroll group = `PAYROLL_MASTER_SETTING_DETAILS`.
- [ ] Regression: existing `employee` middle select/resident-tax path không bị đổi behavior.
- [ ] Regression: `payment_destination`, `attandance_group`, `accounting_dept`, `workflow`, `dept`, salary import vẫn đi theo flow cũ.
- [ ] Manual QA: Không thực hiện Browser/manual QA trên Jinji trong agent; chỉ mô tả expected scenarios cho human/staging QA.

## Risks & Mitigations
- UI expose leaf backend không support → Static check group map against `MasterSettingImportRegistry::SCHEMAS`; không thêm `affiliation_job_title`.
- Role filtering bị bypass → Build groups từ intersection với PHP-injected `menu_selection.setting_hr.detail`, không render hardcode độc lập.
- Duplicate asset/config paths drift → Update active `application/modules/common/...` trước, mirror `assets/templates/...` sau, static check cả hai path.
- `#js-midItems` đang dùng cho employee → Gate logic bằng current top menu; giữ employee resident-tax branch riêng.
- Step 3/template fields hiển thị toàn bộ `setting_hr` thay vì leaf → Update `Import::setting_fields()` và fields config cùng task.
- Legacy details trong `setting_hr` bị ẩn sai → Grouped UI chỉ dành cho master setting reference; giữ legacy entries trong constants/config và không xóa flow cũ nếu screen khác cần.

## Rollback Steps
1. Restore `application/modules/common/views/import/import_step_1.php` to previous flat detail rendering behavior.
2. Restore active `application/modules/common/assets/hr/js/import/import_index.js` and `custom.js` to previous flat `setting_hr` dropdown behavior.
3. Restore `assets/templates/hr/js/import/import_index.js` and `custom.js` to match rollback state.
4. Revert additions in `MENU_DETAIL_SETTING_HR_IMPORT`, `fields.php`, and `Import.php` only if they were introduced solely for grouped UI and not needed by existing backend-supported import.
5. Re-run PHP/JS syntax checks and confirm `人事設定` is back to flat dropdown behavior.

## Definition of Done
- [ ] `人事設定` Step 1 shows group dropdown in reference order.
- [ ] Selecting `基本情報` shows 7 leaf labels without `基本情報_` prefix.
- [ ] Selecting `給与計算` shows 4 leaf labels and only `更新`.
- [ ] Other master setting groups show only backend-supported, role-filtered leaf options.
- [ ] Request payload still uses leaf `menu_detail`.
- [ ] Required CSV headers/template fields match selected leaf.
- [ ] Active and template asset paths are synchronized.
- [ ] PHP/JS syntax checks and static consistency checks pass.
- [ ] No Browser/manual QA was performed by agent on Jinji.

## Notes for Implementer
- Preserve Japanese labels exactly: `資格・免許`, `単身赴任区分`, `給与勤怠単価`, `賞与控除単価`.
- Do not add `所属 > 役職` unless backend schema `affiliation_job_title` is explicitly approved/implemented.
- Do not change `jinjer_hr_core` unless static checks reveal a mismatch that the product owner approves.
- Keep changes minimal; avoid broad JS refactors outside `setting_hr` grouped UI.
- Record exact validation commands and results in implementation output.

